COMPILATION OF: E46M25

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   9 c        put file(outf) list(v,p);
COMP REQ                             ?
    1 ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M25

   1 a 0000 E46M25:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] THE SECOND-ITEM GUARD: a POINTER in position 2.
   4 a 0006      [C290] records that NO object on either route prints a pointer,
   5 a 0006      so this boundary class has no DR answer anywhere -- which is why
   6 a 0006      it is probed, not assumed. */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying, p pointer;
   8 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M25OUT DAT');
   9 c 0023   put file(outf) list(v,p);
  10 c 0041   close file(outf);
  11 a 0047 end E46M25;

CODE SIZE = 004A
DATA AREA = 0021
FREE SYMS = 389A
END  COMPILATION
